{
  "bodyHash": "d5b95537cd549c04",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 据采访报道，多位受访者坚持声称他们目睹了“尸体复活并攻击他人”的情景，其中一人甚至声称看到了“死鸟在空中飞翔”。前一天，CDC发言人仍坚称所谓的“僵尸袭击”纯属无稽之谈，只是看了太多电影产生的幻觉，并继续建议公众待在室内，同时表示有效药物正处于临床试验阶段。</span></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 然而，大量民众仍处于恐慌之中，驾车逃离受感染的城市和国家，导致交通严重拥堵。截至撰写本文时，总统已签署行政命令，宣布在全国实施军事管制。</span></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 史上最完整（开玩笑的）！生存主义者的装备与补给清单！现在开始学习如何保护自己免受僵尸群的攻击，并准备你自己的生存套件！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 本模组提供了一系列在僵尸末日中生存的工具，包括武器、防御装备、药品等。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 此外，该模组还提供了多种材料，允许整合包作者修改物品的合成配方，使整合包更具现代感，而无需引入复杂的技术类模组。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eJEYhZooBik\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/772/86/2023-12-05_10.png\" width=\"1857\" height=\"984\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">警告：从1.6版本开始，本模组需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib</a> 作为依赖项；从2.0 beta版本开始，还需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sona-survival-101\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sona Survival 101</a> 作为依赖项，这更改了部分物品ID，因此在更新前请务必备份你的存档！</span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f90\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">配合 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pillagers-gun\" rel=\"nofollow\">掠夺者之枪</a>，掠夺者将使用枪支与怪物战斗！</span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f90\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/guard-villagers\" rel=\"nofollow\">守卫村民</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recruits\" rel=\"nofollow\">村民新兵</a> 也将使用重机枪！</span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">本模组现已兼容 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a>！</span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/730/25/patchouli.png\" alt=\"Patchouli book\" width=\"1094\" height=\"729\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>建议</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 为了平衡枪械模组，本模组的武器和护甲具有更高的伤害和防御值。因此，最好与其他增强生物模组的模组配合使用，例如 <a href=\"#\" rel=\"nofollow\">Consecration</a>、<a href=\"#\" rel=\"nofollow\">EnhancedAI</a> 和 <a href=\"#\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mobs Properties Randomness</a>。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>增益与减益效果</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">1. 混乱 (Confusion)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">使怪物无法发现目标。如果玩家拥有此减益效果，会导致恶心。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">2. 脆弱 (Fragile)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">降低护甲值。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">3. 免疫 (Immunity)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">帮助你控制感染，并对不死生物以及模组中标记为 \"undead_mob\" 且以近战攻击玩家的怪物施加大量减益效果（可通过数据包自定义）。但高等级的免疫状态会 <strong>杀死玩家</strong>。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">4. 镇痛 (Analgesic)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">免疫虚弱、<strong>挖掘疲劳</strong>和迟缓。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">5. 伪装 (Camouflage)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">隐藏你自己。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">6. 暴露 (Exposure)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">敌人已经发现了你。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">7. 眩晕 (Stunned)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">哦，那很疼。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>武器与工具</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">1. 撬棍</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">造成迟缓效果。右键点击可以撬开门和箱子。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">2. 棒球棍</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">具有横扫攻击，并能击退怪物。但伤害和耐久度较低。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">3. 砍刀</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">具有横扫攻击，效果类似剑。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">4. 消防斧</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">造成极高的伤害并使目标处于脆弱状态，但攻击速度非常低。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">5. 匕首</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">伤害低但速度极快。右键点击会对未攻击你的敌人造成巨额伤害。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">6. 钉耙</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">拥有更长的攻击范围。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">7. 扳手</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">可以投掷，蓄力后可以眩晕敌人。副手使用时可以操作设备。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">8. 胆汁罐</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">对所有怪物造成混乱效果。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">9. 药水瓶</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">对不死生物及模组中标记为 \"undead_mob\" 的怪物造成脆弱、迟缓和虚弱效果。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">10. 莫洛托夫鸡尾酒（仿制）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">焚烧一切。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>防御装备</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">1. 滑雪服</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">全套穿着增加移动速度，护目镜免疫失明，靴子可以在细雪上行走。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">2. 标准/防暴战术服</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">外观帅气，并在特定生物群系中隐藏玩家。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">3. 防爆服</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">牺牲攻击力和移动速度以获得更高的护甲值。全套穿着提供生命提升和抗性效果。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">4. EXO 装甲</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">极其酷炫，装甲的每一部分都会为你提供增益效果。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>医疗用品</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">1. 绷带</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">治愈自身。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">2. 止痛药</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">提供吸收效果和镇痛效果。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">3. 医疗包</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">专业的医疗工具，可用于治疗和治疗疼痛。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">4. 奇迹药物</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">治愈感染，并为玩家提供大量增益效果，并 <strong>增加</strong> 一级免疫。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">5. 可疑药物</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">哦！真恶心。但也许它能治愈感染？</span></p>\n</div>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>感染系统</strong></span></h3><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">现在，近战攻击不死生物或食用受感染的食物会导致你感染。受伤次数越多，病情越严重！请照顾好自己！你的盔甲可以保护你！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">盔甲可以减少受到的感染，盔甲韧性有助于抵抗感染！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以使用命令 <strong>/infection</strong> 来设置/获取玩家的感染等级。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">0 - 40 无特殊效果</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">40 - 70 饥饿</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">70 - 90 虚弱、缓慢、饥饿</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">90 - 99 虚弱II、缓慢、饥饿、失明</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">100 死亡</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>此外，感染等级会缓慢增加。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">和平难度：每1600刻（80秒）减少1点（低于40时）</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">简单难度：每1600刻减少1点（低于40时）</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">普通难度：每1600刻减少1点（低于40时），每1600刻增加1点（高于70时）</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">困难难度：每1600刻增加1点（高于40时）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>你可以使用数据包设置治愈感染的物品。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">带有标签 \"infection_decrease\" 的物品会降低15点感染等级。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">带有标签 \"infection_clear\" 的物品可以治愈玩家。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">带有标签 \"undead_mob\" 的生物会在近战攻击时导致感染。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">带有标签 \"infected_food\" 的食物会造成10级感染。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>你可以使用游戏规则 disableInfection 来禁用感染系统。</strong></span></p>\n</div>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>流血系统</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">现在受到伤害不仅会减少生命值，还会造成伤口并导致玩家流血。受到的伤害越高，伤口越严重。小伤口会随时间慢慢愈合，但如果伤势过重且未得到治疗，情况会恶化。失血会使玩家逐渐变弱，甚至吸引僵尸。因此，需要及时使用医疗用品处理伤口。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">游戏内HUD显示100减去流血值。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">0 - 20 你很健康。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">20 - 40 脆弱。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">40 - 60 脆弱II、虚弱、暴露和缓慢。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">60 - 80 脆弱IV、虚弱II、暴露和缓慢。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">80 - 99 脆弱VI、虚弱II、暴露和缓慢II。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">100 死亡。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">如果你的伤口已包扎，则不会吸引僵尸。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以使用游戏规则 disablebleed 来禁用流血系统。</span></strong></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">其他</span></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">现在掠夺者会与怪物一起攻击！</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>未来计划：</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">更多药物（已完成）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">陷阱（已完成）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">弩</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">EXO装备充电，更多EXO装备能力</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">更多迷彩风格（已完成）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">电锯</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">感染系统（已完成）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">帕秋莉手册（已完成）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">任何好主意</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>贡献者</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Konn_gara</strong> - 程序</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Kyoko</strong> - 美术</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>阿琦</strong> - 美术</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>白久谷</strong> - 建模</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>IronCurtain</strong> - 建模</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>lan2418</strong> - 翻译</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>轩影LHXQing</strong> - 结构</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Scarasol</strong>&nbsp;- 吉祥物</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>我服务器上的所有人</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>常见问题解答</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>1. Fabric和其他版本？</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 抱歉，因为我同时在进行三个模组的工作，我没有精力将模组移植到其他版本。但是，我欢迎其他人这样做。<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>2.整合包？</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 你可以在非商业服务器和整合包中使用它。用于商业用途，你需要获得我的许可。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>3.重新发布？</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 不可以。</span></p>",
